{"text": "When people are close to each other. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Under the same roof. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They are bound to rub each other the wrong way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Without proper conflict resolution. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Children are bound to disconnect from their parents. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Especially in their teens. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As parents. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We are also tasked with several roles we have to play in the life of our children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Including disciplinarian in chief. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sometimes depending on how we handle different situations. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It might conflict with our childs wishes or desires. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which might alienate them from us. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In such cases. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They may find it easier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To open up to a relative or a close family friend. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than to their parent. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This is why a community village was vitally important. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Such that when a child felt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were not getting a fair shake from their parents. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They would approach a close relative. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who would steer them in the right direction. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And, in most cases. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Back into the arms of their parents.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "c", "l", "o", "s", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "U", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "m", "e", " ", "r", "o", "o", "f", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "